{"title":"Career Roadmap: Apparel Designer","role":"Apparel Designer","summary":"An Apparel Designer develops clothing collections and individual garments from concept through design development and production. The role combines fashion aesthetics, textile knowledge, garment construction, technical design, trend research, CAD, fit, costing and commercial awareness.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Fashion Design"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in fashion design, garment construction, textiles, fashion illustration, CAD, trend research, merchandising and apparel production"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Apparel Designer develops clothing collections and individual garments from concept through design development and production. The role combines fashion aesthetics, textile knowledge, garment construction, technical design, trend research, CAD, fit, costing and commercial awareness."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Fashion Design","Fashion Fundamentals","Drawing & Illustration","Textile Knowledge","Pattern Making","Draping","Garment Construction","Fashion CAD","Trend Forecasting","Collection Development","Technical Design","Sampling & Fit","Production","Fashion Merchandising","Internship","Apparel Designer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fashion Design Intern","Design Assistant","Junior Apparel Designer","Apparel Designer","Senior Apparel Designer","Design Lead","Design Manager / Creative Director"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof / Portfolio","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Drawing, design fundamentals, textiles, fashion history"},{"text":"Studio projects + fundamentals"},{"text":"Fashion sketches, moodboards, textile studies"},{"text":"Only making attractive sketches"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Pattern making, draping, sewing, garment construction"},{"text":"Studio + workshops"},{"text":"Garment samples, patterns, construction documentation"},{"text":"Weak technical construction skills"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"CAD, collection development, trend research, fashion business"},{"text":"Projects + industry exposure"},{"text":"Complete mini collections, CAD flats, tech packs"},{"text":"Designing without production understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Industry specialization, internship, portfolio, capstone"},{"text":"Internship + major project"},{"text":"Professional collection + portfolio + internship"},{"text":"Portfolio lacking commercial/technical work"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Drawing and visual communication"},{"text":"Fashion illustration basics"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Fashion history"},{"text":"Visual research"},{"text":"Moodboards"},{"text":"Basic digital design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Textile fundamentals"},{"text":"Fibre and yarn knowledge"},{"text":"Fabric construction"},{"text":"Surface design"},{"text":"Sewing fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic garment construction"},{"text":"Fashion sketching"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pattern making"},{"text":"Flat pattern techniques"},{"text":"Draping"},{"text":"Garment construction"},{"text":"Silhouette development"},{"text":"Apparel details"},{"text":"Design development"},{"text":"Indian and global apparel traditions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced pattern development"},{"text":"Textile experimentation"},{"text":"Fashion CAD"},{"text":"Technica